    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xov45az",
      "content": "Bhubaneswar is known as the 'Temple City of India'. Once it had over 7,000 temples; around 500 survive today. It is the finest example of Kalinga/Odishan temple architecture."
    },
    {
      "id": "qa7ml96",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
